    "HDR" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "HDR 素材会自动做色调映射，高光平滑压缩而不过曝。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR footage is tone-mapped automatically, so highlights roll off smoothly instead of clipping."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HDR10（PQ）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR10 (PQ)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HDR10：适合电视和专业平台，带 1000 尼特 HDR10 元数据。普通屏幕上依赖播放器做色调映射。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HDR10: for TVs and professional platforms, with 1000-nit HDR10 metadata. On SDR screens it relies on the player for tone mapping."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HDR（HLG，推荐）" : {
